\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs30\b\cf1 RTF fidelity and limits}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 RiqatonyPad writes standards-based RTF for its supported subset. Supported core content includes Unicode text, fonts and character formatting, colours and highlights, paragraph formatting, tabs and manual line breaks, standard bullet lists, safe hyperlinks, embedded PNG/JPEG images, horizontal rules, simple bounded non-nested tables, and supported page size/margin/orientation properties.}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 RiqatonyPad-created bullet lists use standard RTF list structures so external readers can recognise them as semantic lists. Standard decimal lists already present in imported RTF may be preserved for interoperability, but RiqatonyPad does not provide a Numbered List creation command.}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 RiqatonyPad does not promise lossless editing of every RTF feature. OLE/object payloads, shapes, comments, footnotes/endnotes, tracked revisions, nested tables, complex bidirectional controls, advanced tab leaders, document headers/footers and producer-specific extensions may be unsupported or only partially supported. Properties reports known compatibility warnings, and a dirty save warns before rewriting unsupported content through RiqatonyPad's supported subset.}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs30\b\cf1 Printing and PDF}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 Print and Export PDF use the same paginated document-rendering path. Page Setup configures optional print-only headers and footers with independent Left, Centre and Right fields. These print headers and footers are output decoration; they are not imported RTF document headers or footers.}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 Page Setup placeholders are: &F filename, &P page number, &N total pages, &D date, &T time, &A application name and &C Confidential.}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs30\b\cf1 Help and documentation}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 F1 opens this bundled documentation in a separate RiqatonyPad window. The documentation window is opened in Locked Mode so the installed copy is not edited accidentally; use Save As if you want an editable copy.}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 Help also provides Quick Tour (Shift+F1), Keyboard Shortcuts (Ctrl+Shift+/), GitHub Repository, Raise an Issue and About RiqatonyPad.}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb100\sa100\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs30\b\cf1 Project}\par
\pard\ql\li0\ri0\fi0\sb0\sa120\sl276\slmult1 {\plain\f0\fs24 RiqatonyPad is built on Python, PyQt6, Nuxpad 2, PyWordpad and Microsoft WordPad-inspired document features. PyWordpad is acknowledged as a behavioural reference; this statement does not make a licensing claim about PyWordpad.}\par
